Package: cgjrdata
Title: Data Preparation for the Country Jobs and Growth Report
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Ifeanyi", "Edochie", email = "iedochie@worldbank.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Pulls, processes and packages the indicators that make up the
    World Bank Country Jobs and Growth Report (CGJR) analytical framework.
    Every indicator's placement in the taxonomy lives in a single crosswalk
    table (cgjr_crosswalk), validated against cliaretl's own eligibility
    flags at build time. Provides lazyloaded objects for use by the cgjrapp
    Shiny dashboard including rawdata_list (raw source panels), ctfdata_list
    (Closeness-to-Frontier dynamic scores with subcluster score columns),
    metadata_tbl (variable catalogue), institutional_averages_tbl (cluster
    and overall aggregated scores), and region / income-group aggregates.
